The fresh distinct review on predecessor exact head `0fb13146...` also found P1 `Restore durable claim ordering to the repair contract` and P2 `Require the five-stage gate in the structured merge rule`. The repair now explicitly requires durable claim success before observer/downstream work with fail-closed replay/one-winner semantics, and `POM_RX_TASKS.yaml` explicitly encodes the mandatory five-stage pre-merge gate. Because the head moved, the predecessor CI/review is stale for release and these repairs require fresh exact-head validation before their threads are resolved.

